  "description": "Vali-Flow is a .NET library that simplifies data access in Entity Framework Core applications via a fluent specification API. Provides ValiFlowEvaluator for querying and writing data, QuerySpecification and BasicSpecification for defining query criteria, and bulk operation support via EFCore.BulkExtensions.",
